                        1929, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 667</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d435-f3" n="39" xml:id="d435-f3-content">
                <p>See telegram of December 28, 1929, from the Consul at Nanking, <ref
                        target="frus1929v02#pg_666"><hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p.
                    666</ref>; also memorandum from the French Embassy, December 30, 1929, <ref
