                    670</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d435-f4" n="40" xml:id="d435-f4-content">
                <p>Sino-French treaty signed at Tientsin, June 27, 1858, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >British and Foreign State Papers</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >li</hi>, p. 637.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d435-f5" n="41" xml:id="d435-f5-content">
                <p>Signed at Washington Conference, February 6, 1922; <ref
                        target="frus1922v01#pg_276"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1922, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 276</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
